          role: "system",
          content: 'You are a translation assistant. Translate the given text into exactly 4 languages: English (en), French (fr), Haitian Creole (ht), and Spanish (es). Return ONLY a valid JSON object with keys "en", "fr", "ht", "es". No extra text, no markdown, no explanation.'
